{"id":"431808","name":"番茄紫菜豆腐汤","author":"欣欣向荣2388","authorId":"476535","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/431808/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"一小块"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"一小束"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"两个"},{"name":"紫菜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"少许"},{"name":"油","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"西红柿去皮切小丁。","img":"images/431808/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆腐切小丁。","img":"images/431808/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"金针菇去根洗净撕碎。","img":"images/431808/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅热倒入少许油加入番茄丁翻炒片刻。","img":"images/431808/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒去豆腐。","img":"images/431808/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入适量水。","img":"images/431808/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入紫菜。","img":"images/431808/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烧开后放入金针菇。","img":"images/431808/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"烧开后倒入蛋液，加入盐鸡精调味，撒上葱花。","img":"images/431808/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装入碗中即成食用。","img":"images/431808/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}